# Project Module 2 – Networkwalks Tools

## Overview
This project focuses on PDF password recovery using Networkwalks tools.

## Tools Used
- Networkwalks Hash Calculator
- Networkwalks Password Cracker
- Kali Linux

## Tasks Completed
- Uploaded the assigned password-protected PDF.
- Extracted the PDF hash.
- Submitted the hash to the Password Cracker.
- Used an additional wordlist.
- Recovered the password.
- Verified the password by opening the PDF.

## Evidence
The Screenshot is included to demonstrate the practical task results.
